  "name": "Collections Policy Execution Assistant",
  "description": "An AI assistant that Ingests, configures, and manages collections policies by translating business-defined rules, thresholds, and strategies into structured, system-enforceable logic. Establishes the foundation for customer prioritization, risk evaluation, and next-best action generation across collections workflows. Ensures policy consistency, governance, and audit while enabling seamless updates and controlled policy evolution.",
