          "code": "CONVERT_INTO_FINAL_JSON",
          "id": "1776447803608",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776447803609_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "INPUTS:\n--------\n- Input JSON :  {{$context.$nodes.VALIDATEINPUT.$output}} \n- Business Terms Taxonomy:  {{$context.$variables.bttaxonomy}} \n- Supported Next Best Action Taxonomy:  {{$context.$variables.nbataxonomy}}\n\nYou are a transformation engine. Convert Input JSON into normalized output JSON with this shape:\n\n{\n  \"priorityCategorization\": [...],\n  \"orderBy\": [...],\n  \"nextBestAction\": [...]\n}\n\n\n\n\nSTRICT RULES:\n- Use only the provided Business Terms Taxonomy for all metric mappings.\n- Use only the provided Supported Next Best Action Taxonomy for all action mappings.\n- No hardcoded metric codes.\n- No hardcoded actions.\n- No free-text action output.\n- Preserve exact taxonomy values for action fields.\n- Output must be valid JSON only.\n- Ignore any input not needed for the final output.\n- If a field or action cannot be resolved from the required taxonomies, skip it or flag it.\n- Do NOT derive priorityCategorization from NextBestAction\n- Use ONLY input priorityCategorization section\n\n\nMANDATORY TAXONOMY DEPENDENCIES:\n\n1) Business Terms Taxonomy\n- Source of truth for:\n  - metric_code (rules)\n  - field (orderBy)\n- Normalize before lookup (trim, case-insensitive)\n\n2) Supported Next Best Action Taxonomy\n- Source of truth for:\n  - invokeAction, code, description, label\n- ALL actions must come from this taxonomy\n- Split \"+\" into multiple actions\n- Preserve order\n- Never merge actions\n\n---\n\n========================\nA. NEXTBESTACTION LOGIC\n========================\n\n- Use:\n  - if → rules\n  - then → actions\n  - because → ignore\n\nOPERATORS:\n- more than / exceeds → >\n- less than → <\n- at least → >=\n- at most → <=\n- between → between\n\nLOGIC:\n- AND / OR\n\nRULE FORMAT:\n\nSingle:\n{ \"metric_code\": \"...\", \"operator\": \"...\", \"value\": ... }\n\nMultiple:\n{\n  \"logic\": \"AND|OR\",\n  \"rules\": [ ... ]\n}\n\nNested groups allowed (≤3 levels)\n\n---\n\nACTION FORMAT (MANDATORY FULL OBJECT):\n\n{\n  \"invokeAction\": \"callCustomer\",\n  \"code\": \"CALLCUSTOMER\",\n  \"description\": \"Direct outreach to confirm status, remove blockers, negotiate payment timing, or obtain commitment.\",\n  \"label\": \"Call Customer\"\n}\n\nRULES:\n- Split \"+\"\n- Map each action via taxonomy\n- Preserve order\n- Never merge\n- Never drop\n- Never invent\n\n---\n\n========================\nLOGICAL PATTERN EXAMPLES\n========================\n\n(Abridged for brevity — same as previous full definitions retained)\n\n- A\n- A AND B\n- A OR B\n- A AND B AND C\n- (A AND B) OR C\n- A AND (B OR C)\n- Nested ≤3\n- BETWEEN\n\n(All examples behave exactly as previously defined)\n\n---\nLOGICAL PATTERN EXAMPLES:\n\n1) A\nInput:\n{\n  \"if\": \"Total Past Due Balance > 50000\",\n  \"then\": \"Call Customer\"\n}\nOutput:\n{\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"TOTALPASTDUEBALANCE\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 50000\n    }\n  ],\n  \"logic\": \"AND\",\n  \"nextBestAction\": [\n    {\n      \"invokeAction\": \"callCustomer\",\n      \"code\": \"CALLCUSTOMER\",\n      \"description\": \"Direct outreach to confirm status, remove blockers, negotiate payment timing, or obtain commitment.\",\n      \"label\": \"Call Customer\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n2) A AND B\nInput:\n{\n  \"if\": \"% Balance Past Due > 50 AND Aging Bucket > 60\",\n  \"then\": \"Call Customer\"\n}\nOutput:\n{\n  \"logic\": \"AND\",\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"PERCENTBALANCEPASTDUE\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 50\n    },\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"AGINGBUCKETS\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 60\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nextBestAction\": [\n    {\n      \"invokeAction\": \"callCustomer\",\n      \"code\": \"CALLCUSTOMER\",\n      \"description\": \"Direct outreach to confirm status, remove blockers, negotiate payment timing, or obtain commitment.\",\n      \"label\": \"Call Customer\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n3) A OR B\nInput:\n{\n  \"if\": \"Total Past Due Balance > 50000 OR Largest Overdue Invoice > 25000\",\n  \"then\": \"Call Customer\"\n}\nOutput:\n{\n  \"logic\": \"OR\",\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"TOTALPASTDUEBALANCE\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 50000\n    },\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"LARGESTOPENINVOICE\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 25000\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nextBestAction\": [\n    {\n      \"invokeAction\": \"callCustomer\",\n      \"code\": \"CALLCUSTOMER\",\n      \"description\": \"Direct outreach to confirm status, remove blockers, negotiate payment timing, or obtain commitment.\",\n      \"label\": \"Call Customer\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n4) A AND B AND C\nInput:\n{\n  \"if\": \"% Balance Past Due > 50 AND Aging Bucket > 60 AND Total Past Due Balance > 10000\",\n  \"then\": \"Call Customer\"\n}\nOutput:\n{\n  \"logic\": \"AND\",\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"PERCENTBALANCEPASTDUE\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 50\n    },\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"AGINGBUCKETS\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 60\n    },\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"TOTALPASTDUEBALANCE\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 10000\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nextBestAction\": [\n    {\n      \"invokeAction\": \"callCustomer\",\n      \"code\": \"CALLCUSTOMER\",\n      \"description\": \"Direct outreach to confirm status, remove blockers, negotiate payment timing, or obtain commitment.\",\n      \"label\": \"Call Customer\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n5) (A AND B) OR C\nInput:\n{\n  \"if\": \"(% Balance Past Due > 50 AND Aging Bucket > 60) OR Total Past Due Balance > 50000\",\n  \"then\": \"Call Customer\"\n}\nOutput:\n{\n  \"logic\": \"OR\",\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"logic\": \"AND\",\n      \"rules\": [\n        {\n          \"metric_code\": \"PERCENTBALANCEPASTDUE\",\n          \"operator\": \">\",\n          \"value\": 50\n        },\n        {\n          \"metric_code\": \"AGINGBUCKETS\",\n          \"operator\": \">\",\n          \"value\": 60\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"TOTALPASTDUEBALANCE\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 50000\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nextBestAction\": [\n    {\n      \"invokeAction\": \"callCustomer\",\n      \"code\": \"CALLCUSTOMER\",\n      \"description\": \"Direct outreach to confirm status, remove blockers, negotiate payment timing, or obtain commitment.\",\n      \"label\": \"Call Customer\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n6) A AND (B OR C)\nInput:\n{\n  \"if\": \"Total Past Due Balance > 10000 AND (% Balance Past Due > 50 OR Aging Bucket > 60)\",\n  \"then\": \"Call Customer\"\n}\nOutput:\n{\n  \"logic\": \"AND\",\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"TOTALPASTDUEBALANCE\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 10000\n    },\n    {\n      \"logic\": \"OR\",\n      \"rules\": [\n        {\n          \"metric_code\": \"PERCENTBALANCEPASTDUE\",\n          \"operator\": \">\",\n          \"value\": 50\n        },\n        {\n          \"metric_code\": \"AGINGBUCKETS\",\n          \"operator\": \">\",\n          \"value\": 60\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nextBestAction\": [\n    {\n      \"invokeAction\": \"callCustomer\",\n      \"code\": \"CALLCUSTOMER\",\n      \"description\": \"Direct outreach to confirm status, remove blockers, negotiate payment timing, or obtain commitment.\",\n      \"label\": \"Call Customer\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n7) Nested (≤3 levels)\nInput:\n{\n  \"if\": \"(A AND (B OR C)) OR D\",\n  \"then\": \"Call Customer\"\n}\nOutput pattern:\n{\n  \"logic\": \"OR\",\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"logic\": \"AND\",\n      \"rules\": [\n        { \"metric_code\": \"A\", \"operator\": \"...\", \"value\": ... },\n        {\n          \"logic\": \"OR\",\n          \"rules\": [\n            { \"metric_code\": \"B\", \"operator\": \"...\", \"value\": ... },\n            { \"metric_code\": \"C\", \"operator\": \"...\", \"value\": ... }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"D\",\n      \"operator\": \"...\",\n      \"value\": ...\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nextBestAction\": [\n    {\n      \"invokeAction\": \"callCustomer\",\n      \"code\": \"CALLCUSTOMER\",\n      \"description\": \"Direct outreach to confirm status, remove blockers, negotiate payment timing, or obtain commitment.\",\n      \"label\": \"Call Customer\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n8) BETWEEN\nInput:\n{\n  \"if\": \"Total Past Due Balance between 10000 and 50000\",\n  \"then\": \"Call Customer\"\n}\nOutput:\n{\n  \"logic\": \"AND\",\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"TOTALPASTDUEBALANCE\",\n      \"operator\": \"between\",\n      \"value\": [10000, 50000]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nextBestAction\": [\n    {\n      \"invokeAction\": \"callCustomer\",\n      \"code\": \"CALLCUSTOMER\",\n      \"description\": \"Direct outreach to confirm status, remove blockers, negotiate payment timing, or obtain commitment.\",\n      \"label\": \"Call Customer\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nMULTIPLE NEXTBESTACTIONS:\n- If then contains multiple actions separated by \"+\", produce multiple full action objects in order.\n- Never collapse multiple actions into one code.\n- Never omit fields.\n\nExample:\nInput:\n{\n  \"if\": \"% Balance Past Due > 50 AND Aging Bucket > 60\",\n  \"then\": \"Call Customer + Request Promise-to-Pay\"\n}\nOutput:\n{\n  \"logic\": \"AND\",\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"PERCENTBALANCEPASTDUE\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 50\n    },\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"AGINGBUCKETS\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 60\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nextBestAction\": [\n    {\n      \"invokeAction\": \"callCustomer\",\n      \"code\": \"CALLCUSTOMER\",\n      \"description\": \"Direct outreach to confirm status, remove blockers, negotiate payment timing, or obtain commitment.\",\n      \"label\": \"Call Customer\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"invokeAction\": \"requestPromiseToPay\",\n      \"code\": \"REQUESTPROMISETOPAY\",\n      \"description\": \"Ask the customer to commit to a specific payment date and amount when urgency is elevated.\",\n      \"label\": \"Request Promise-to-Pay\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nAnother example:\nInput:\n{\n  \"if\": \"Total Past Due Balance > 50000\",\n  \"then\": \"Call Customer + Request Promise-to-Pay + Escalate to Credit Risk Team\"\n}\nOutput:\n{\n  \"logic\": \"AND\",\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"TOTALPASTDUEBALANCE\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 50000\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nextBestAction\": [\n    {\n      \"invokeAction\": \"callCustomer\",\n      \"code\": \"CALLCUSTOMER\",\n      \"description\": \"Direct outreach to confirm status, remove blockers, negotiate payment timing, or obtain commitment.\",\n      \"label\": \"Call Customer\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"invokeAction\": \"requestPromiseToPay\",\n      \"code\": \"REQUESTPROMISETOPAY\",\n      \"description\": \"Ask the customer to commit to a specific payment date and amount when urgency is elevated.\",\n      \"label\": \"Request Promise-to-Pay\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"invokeAction\": \"escalateToCreditRiskTeam\",\n      \"code\": \"ESCALATETOCREDITRISKTEAM\",\n      \"description\": \"Hand off higher-risk cases or policy exceptions to specialists.\",\n      \"label\": \"Escalate to Credit Risk Team\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n========================================\nB. CUSTOMER PRIORITIZATION → orderBy\n========================================\n\nRULES:\n- Sort by Order Number ASC\n- Map BusinessTerm → field using Business Terms Taxonomy\n- Normalize direction (asc/desc)\n- Default:\n  - Risk / Aging → desc\n  - Performance → asc\n- Flatten output\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT:\n{\n  \"field\": \"<METRIC_CODE>\",\n  \"direction\": \"asc|desc\"\n}\n\n---\n\n========================\nORDERBY FEW-SHOT EXAMPLES\n========================\n\n1) SINGLE FIELD\n\nInput:\n{\n  \"CustomerPrioritization\": [\n    {\n      \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n      \"Order Number\": 1,\n      \"BusinessTerm\": \"Total Past Due Balance\",\n      \"direction\": \"desc\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"orderBy\": [\n    {\n      \"field\": \"TOTALPASTDUEBALANCE\",\n      \"direction\": \"desc\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n---\n\n2) MULTIPLE FIELDS\n\nInput:\n{\n  \"CustomerPrioritization\": [\n    {\n      \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n      \"Order Number\": 2,\n      \"BusinessTerm\": \"Largest Overdue Invoice\",\n      \"direction\": \"desc\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n      \"Order Number\": 1,\n      \"BusinessTerm\": \"Total Past Due Balance\",\n      \"direction\": \"desc\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"orderBy\": [\n    {\n      \"field\": \"TOTALPASTDUEBALANCE\",\n      \"direction\": \"desc\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"field\": \"LARGESTOPENINVOICE\",\n      \"direction\": \"desc\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n---\n\n3) DEFAULT DIRECTION (MISSING)\n\nInput:\n{\n  \"CustomerPrioritization\": [\n    {\n      \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n      \"Order Number\": 1,\n      \"BusinessTerm\": \"Total Past Due Balance\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"orderBy\": [\n    {\n      \"field\": \"TOTALPASTDUEBALANCE\",\n      \"direction\": \"desc\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n------\n\n========================\nA1. PRIORITYCATEGORIZATION LOGIC (NEW)\n========================\n\n- Source: Input JSON → priorityCategorization.rules\n\n- Transform each rule into normalized format:\n\n{\n  \"logic\": \"AND|OR\",\n  \"rules\": [...],\n  \"priority\": \"HIGH|MEDIUM|LOW\"\n}\n\nRULE MAPPING:\n\n- structured_interpretation.if → rules\n- structured_interpretation.Priority → priority\n\n- Use SAME operator normalization as NextBestAction:\n  >, <, >=, <=, between\n\n- Convert phrases:\n  \"any amount exists in X\" → X > 0\n  \"no amount exists in X\" → X = 0\n\n- Preserve logical structure:\n  - AND / OR\n  - Nested allowed (≤3 levels)\n\n- ALWAYS follow:\n\nLOGICAL PATTERN EXAMPLES:\n- A\n- A AND B\n- A OR B\n- A AND B AND C\n- (A AND B) OR C\n- A AND (B OR C)\n- Nested ≤3\n- BETWEEN\n\n----------------------------------------\nPRIORITYCATEGORIZATION EXAMPLES\n----------------------------------------\n\n1) A (Single Condition)\n\nInput:\n{\n  \"if\": \"Total Past Due Balance > 100000\",\n  \"Priority\": \"HIGH\"\n}\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"logic\": \"AND\",\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"TOTALPASTDUEBALANCE\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 100000\n    }\n  ],\n  \"priority\": \"HIGH\"\n}\n\n----------------------------------------\n\n2) A AND B\n\nInput:\n{\n  \"if\": \"Total Past Due Balance > 100000 AND Total Open Balance > 250000\",\n  \"Priority\": \"HIGH\"\n}\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"logic\": \"AND\",\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"TOTALPASTDUEBALANCE\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 100000\n    },\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"TOTALOPENBALANCE\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 250000\n    }\n  ],\n  \"priority\": \"HIGH\"\n}\n\n----------------------------------------\n\n3) A OR B\n\nInput:\n{\n  \"if\": \"Aging Bucket 31 - 60 days > 0 OR Aging Bucket 61 - 90 days > 0\",\n  \"Priority\": \"HIGH\"\n}\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"logic\": \"OR\",\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"AGINGBUCKETS 31 - 60 DAYS\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 0\n    },\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"AGINGBUCKETS 61 - 90 DAYS\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 0\n    }\n  ],\n  \"priority\": \"HIGH\"\n}\n\n----------------------------------------\n\n4) A AND (B OR C)\n\nInput:\n{\n  \"if\": \"Total Open Balance > 150000 AND (Total Past Due Balance > 75000 OR Largest Open Invoice > 50000)\",\n  \"Priority\": \"HIGH\"\n}\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"logic\": \"AND\",\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"TOTALOPENBALANCE\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 150000\n    },\n    {\n      \"logic\": \"OR\",\n      \"rules\": [\n        {\n          \"metric_code\": \"TOTALPASTDUEBALANCE\",\n          \"operator\": \">\",\n          \"value\": 75000\n        },\n        {\n          \"metric_code\": \"LARGESTOPENINVOICE\",\n          \"operator\": \">\",\n          \"value\": 50000\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"priority\": \"HIGH\"\n}\n\n----------------------------------------\n\n5) BETWEEN\n\nInput:\n{\n  \"if\": \"Total Past Due Balance between 25000 and 100000\",\n  \"Priority\": \"MEDIUM\"\n}\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"logic\": \"AND\",\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"TOTALPASTDUEBALANCE\",\n      \"operator\": \"between\",\n      \"value\": [25000, 100000]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"priority\": \"MEDIUM\"\n}\n\n----------------------------------------\n\n6) Normalization Example (EXISTS → > 0)\n\nInput:\n{\n  \"if\": \"any amount exists in Aging Bucket More than 90 days\",\n  \"Priority\": \"HIGH\"\n}\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"logic\": \"AND\",\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"AGINGBUCKETS MORE THAN 90 DAYS\",\n      \"operator\": \">\",\n      \"value\": 0\n    }\n  ],\n  \"priority\": \"HIGH\"\n}\n\n----------------------------------------\n\n7) Normalization Example (NO AMOUNT → = 0)\n\nInput:\n{\n  \"if\": \"no amount exists in Aging Bucket 31 - 60 days\",\n  \"Priority\": \"LOW\"\n}\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"logic\": \"AND\",\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"metric_code\": \"AGINGBUCKETS 31 - 60 DAYS\",\n      \"operator\": \"=\",\n      \"value\": 0\n    }\n  ],\n  \"priority\": \"LOW\"\n}\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nRULE FORMAT:\n\nSingle:\n{ \"metric_code\": \"...\", \"operator\": \"...\", \"value\": ... }\n\nMultiple:\n{\n  \"logic\": \"AND|OR\",\n  \"rules\": [ ... ]\n}\n\n- metric_code MUST come from Business Terms Taxonomy\n- DO NOT hardcode metric_code\n- DO NOT alter logic structure\n\nPRIORITY RULES:\n- Must be EXACTLY: HIGH | MEDIUM | LOW\n- Preserve original priority\n\nSKIP RULE:\n- If status = ERROR → skip rule entirely\n\n----------------------------\n\n========================\nEND-TO-END EXECUTION\n========================\n\n1. Read input JSON  \n2. Build priorityCategorization  \n3. Build orderBy  \n4. Build nextBestAction  \n5. Map using taxonomies  \n6. Validate  \n7. Return final JSON  \n\n---\n\n========================\nVALIDATION RULES\n========================\n\n- metric_code must exist in taxonomy\n- field must exist in taxonomy\n- actions must exist in action taxonomy\n- actions must include:\n  invokeAction, code, description, label\n- preserve logic structure exactly\n- preserve action order exactly\n- no null / invented values\n- priorityCategorization.rules.metric_code must exist in Business Terms Taxonomy\n- priority must be HIGH | MEDIUM | LOW\n- logic structure must match supported logical patterns\n---\n\n========================\nSUPPORTED\n========================\n\n- numeric conditions\n- currency\n- percentages\n- aging buckets\n- AND / OR logic\n- nested rules\n- BETWEEN\n- multiple actions\n- priorityCategorization transformation\n- priority-based rule mapping\n---\n\n========================\nNOT SUPPORTED\n========================\n\n- strings\n- dates\n- booleans\n- non-taxonomy mappings\n- free-text outputs\n- merging actions\n- modifying priority values\n- flattening nested logical rules\n\n---\n\nOUTPUT ONLY VALID JSON. NO TEXT. NO MARKDOWN."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"orderBy\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\"\n    },\n    \"nextBestAction\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"orderBy\",\n    \"nextBestAction\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
